cover.html
coverage.html
coverage.out
# The v2 coverage-gate report is a generated artifact. It must NOT be
# committed: a stale report checked in beside the gate would either fail the
# schema check (reading as a broken gate) or, worse, be read as the measured
# state of the tree.
coverage.json
# The gate script is a `package main` tool, so `go build scripts/coverage-gate.go`
# drops a ./coverage-gate binary in the working directory. It is a build
# artifact, not source.
/coverage-gate
coverage_*.html
cov_report.html
storage_cov.out

